# Agent Failure Triage Platform - System Walkthrough & Benchmark Report

## 🚀 Executive Summary

The **Agent Failure Triage Platform** has been fully implemented as an automated diagnostic SRE system for multi-step AI agent workflows. It ingests telemetry traces, optimizes token usage via smart pruning, deterministically verifies evidence citations with zero hallucination, classifies root causes into a 9-layer taxonomy, and runs automated regression benchmarks.

